{"id":"c0c477fb00da36dd","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-herbrand-expansion.md","title":"Herbrand Expansion","display":"df-herbrand-expansion — Herbrand Expansion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-herbrand-expansion","aliases":["72-df-herbrand-expansion"],"display":"df-herbrand-expansion — Herbrand Expansion","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.5.1 print48–49/PDF60–61; ground-instance specialization","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-herbrand-expansion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-herbrand-expansion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-herbrand-expansion — Herbrand Expansion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.5.1 print48–49/PDF60–61; ground-instance specialization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 与项、公式采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的精确编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为下式的闭项集合，且非空。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{n-1}\\psi\">\\(\\varphi=\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{n-1}\\psi\\)</span> 是闭合前束全称句；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 无量词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 互异。替换为所有自由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 出现的同时代入，闭项不会引起变量捕获。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inst}_{\\Sigma}(\\psi,\\vec x,\\vec t)\">\\(\\operatorname{Inst}_{\\Sigma}(\\psi,\\vec x,\\vec t)\\)</span> 由下式递归定义。所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_j\">\\(t_j\\)</span> 都是闭项，因而每步满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}\">\\(\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}\\)</span>，且各步不会改动先前代入项。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma:=\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma):\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma:=\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma):\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HExp}_\\Sigma(\\varphi):=\\{\\psi[t_0/x_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}/x_{n-1}]:(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\\in\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HExp}_\\Sigma(\\varphi):=\\{\\psi[t_0/x_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}/x_{n-1}]:(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\\in\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_0:=\\psi,\\qquad B_{j+1}:=\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}(B_j,t_j,x_j)\\quad(j&lt;n),\\qquad\\operatorname{Inst}_{\\Sigma}(\\psi,\\vec x,\\vec t):=B_n,\\qquad\\psi[t_0/x_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}/x_{n-1}]:=\\operatorname{Inst}_{\\Sigma}(\\psi,\\vec x,\\vec t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_0:=\\psi,\\qquad B_{j+1}:=\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}(B_j,t_j,x_j)\\quad(j&lt;n),\\qquad\\operatorname{Inst}_{\\Sigma}(\\psi,\\vec x,\\vec t):=B_n,\\qquad\\psi[t_0/x_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}/x_{n-1}]:=\\operatorname{Inst}_{\\Sigma}(\\psi,\\vec x,\\vec t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>HExp定义全部闭矩阵实例，没有暗中断言任何单实例有效或可证。这里只采用本地五分量语法，避免57同名HU函数的签名漂移。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 与项、公式采用 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的精确编码；$\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma$ 为下式的闭项集合，且非空。$\\varphi=\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{n-1}\\psi$ 是闭合前束全称句；$\\psi$ 无量词，$x_i$ 互异。替换为所有自由 $x_i$ 出现的同时代入，闭项不会引起变量捕获。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi=\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{n-1}\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Inst}_{\\Sigma}(\\psi,\\vec x,\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"t_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma:=\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma):\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HExp}_\\Sigma(\\varphi):=\\{\\psi[t_0/x_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}/x_{n-1}]:(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})\\in\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma^n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"B_0:=\\psi,\\qquad B_{j+1}:=\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}(B_j,t_j,x_j)\\quad(j<n),\\qquad\\operatorname{Inst}_{\\Sigma}(\\psi,\\vec x,\\vec t):=B_n,\\qquad\\psi[t_0/x_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}/x_{n-1}]:=\\operatorname{Inst}_{\\Sigma}(\\psi,\\vec x,\\vec t).","display":true}],"bytes":1790,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-herbrand-expansion|df-herbrand-expansion — Herbrand Expansion]]"},{"id":"6d9f887492f748f6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的 $\\Sigma$ 与 [[72-df-herbrand-expansion]] 的非空 $\\operatorname{HU}_\\Sigma$。$\\varphi=\\exists x_0\\cdots\\exists x_{n-1}\\psi$ 是闭合句，$\\psi$ 无量词且不含等号原子；$x_i$ 互异。"},{"id":"67e22e42f3c205d1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Valid}$ 与 $\\operatorname{PropUnsat}$ 见 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]，其中 $\\operatorname{Valid}(\\chi)$ 取原签名 $\\Sigma$ 的实例，$\\operatorname{PropUnsat}$ 取扩充签名 $\\Sigma^\\prime$ 的实例；$\\operatorname{HU}$ 与矩阵的闭项同时代入取 [[72-df-herbrand-expansion]] 在 $\\Sigma^\\prime$ 的实例。"}],"outgoing":["3c073b947b255638"]}